<!-- ABOUT PROJECT -->
<section class="detail-section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-overline">About Project</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">VORA SKYLINE CENTRICO</h2>
    <div class="about-text">
      
      When you show interest in a particular project, then the conversation starts between you &amp; the structure, which is regarding to own your house or in simple words to nourish your dreams. Thus to fulfill your fantasize VORA SKYLINE <strong>CENTRICO</strong> has arrived. This project shows the passion of the architect in it's design &amp; curves w      <div class="about-more" id="aboutMore">hich is able to upgrade the quality in the life of the people.<br /><br />It is a project where ALL ROADS WILL LEAD YOU. When you think of the destination so called home, Malad is the upcoming center to stand alone with the power to connect everyone - anywhere. Whether it is places to hang out, or choice in sumptuous eating-out options, whether it is entertainment opportunities or everyday shopping ease, whether it is posh neighborhoods or well- networked travel alternatives, you've got them all here.<br /><br />Centrico Luxury Apartments is a sprawling new abode. In a single sweep, it fulfills your penchant for fine living, safeguards your privacy and offers the choicest conveniences, all under one roof. Savour each feature to see how it will completely redefine your life.<br /><br />This quality construction is of 23 storey which is soaring the sky. There are only 2 BHK &amp; 3.5 BHK luxurious apartments which are presenting the unit sizes of 745 Sq.ft To 1278 Sq.ft which is ultra capacious in Nature. It is expected that this structure will head it's head up in the month of MAY 2018. Mr. Vishwas Satodia (architect), Ultratech (Environmental Consultant) &amp; Pramod Kumar &amp; Co (Solicitors) are main pillars of this Monument.<br /><br /><strong>VORA SKYLINE</strong> was founded in 1982 by MR. SHAILESH PRANLAL VORA (Chairman &amp; Managing Director). Today MR. HEM VORA &amp; MR. JIGAR VORA are the Director of the company. He spearheads the group with his vast experience and tremendous expertise in the industry. He is involved in the business development and corporate relationship functions, with over 30 years of experience in the field of construction, he has the ability of transforming barren land into some of the finest architectural complexes.<br /><br />A real building is one on which the eye can light and stay lit. Hence to book your property now, feel free to contact us through phone number which is mentioned above or you can fill a short form placed above. We assure you the best deal as Literature regarding a building is painting, architecture, and engineering.</div>
      <button class="about-toggle-btn" id="aboutToggle" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; toggleAbout()" data-cf-modified-01a08a1283613c9a792866d7-="">Read More <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="14" height="14"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button>
          </div>

    
  </div>
</section>

